- Churn = 5% monthly → average lifetime = 1 / 0.05 = 20 months.
- LTV = $180 * 20 = $3,600.
- If S&M spend last quarter = $300K and new customers = 300 → CAC = $1,000.
- LTV:CAC = 3.6x — healthy. CAC payback = $1,000 / $180 ≈ 5.6 months.

