- Active customers = 1,500 → ARPU = $400/month.
- Gross margin = 25% → contribution = $100/month.
- Churn = 8% monthly → lifetime = 12.5 months.
- LTV = $100 * 12.5 = $1,250.
- CAC (same S&M 300K / 300 new) = $1,000 → LTV:CAC = 1.25x — weak. Payback = $1,000 / $100 = 10 months.

