- Active customers = 700 → ARPU = ~$857/month.
- Gross margin = 40% → contribution = $343/month.
- Churn = 3% monthly → lifetime ≈ 33 months.
- LTV = $343 * 33 ≈ $11,319.
- CAC = $1,000 → LTV:CAC ≈ 11.3x. Payback = $1,000 / $343 ≈ 2.9 months.

